{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17216070","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17216070","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:0:1721607001:1":{"text":"你们几个可以陪艾尔了！","source_cn":"你们几个可以陪艾尔了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x498BB7F47F6E6DC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1721607002:0":{"text":"呼伦，这还是守备军驻地吗？","source_cn":"呼伦，这还是守备军驻地吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BE7288202440BAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721607003:0":{"text":"我还以为是哪个贵族小姐的卧室！","source_cn":"我还以为是哪个贵族小姐的卧室！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF982B19FE203FE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721607004:1":{"text":"哈哈哈哈！呼伦，你别这么说。毕竟人家可是正牌的贵族小姐。","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈！呼伦，你别这么说。毕竟人家可是正牌的贵族小姐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE395A567A69663DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1721607005:1":{"text":"摆弄弓箭的日子太苦了，肯定得玩点童趣的东西找找安慰嘛。","source_cn":"摆弄弓箭的日子太苦了，肯定得玩点童趣的东西找找安慰嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE88DFF7D3C4497C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721607006:1":{"t