xh64":"0xC0230132F0070471","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1721607012:1":{"text":"守备军的模样？你是说，像你们这样满嘴偏见、只会用粗鲁来掩饰无能，这才是所谓的标准吗？","source_cn":"守备军的模样？你是说，像你们这样满嘴偏见、只会用粗鲁来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21E95E212DB6A1C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1721607013:2":{"text":"你——！说谁无能？！别以为你是队长我们就怕你！","source_cn":"你——！说谁无能？！别以为你是队长我们就怕你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5FA608C19D58570","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1721607014:1":{"text":"你不就是靠着你父亲才坐上这个位置的吗？还敢教训我们什么是守备军？","source_cn":"你不就是靠着你父亲才坐上这个位置的吗？还敢教训我们什么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21DF520B71C89AE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1721607015:1":{"text":"既然队长这么自信，不如让我们见识一下？还是说，您怕弄坏了您的宝贝玩偶哭鼻子？","source_cn":"既然队长这么自信，不如让我们见识一下？还是说，您怕弄坏...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DE50C2AB865FEA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1721607016:1":{"text":"很好。既然你们对守备军这个词有这么大的误解，那我就免费给你们上一课。一起上吧。","source_cn":"很好。既然你们对守备军这个词有这么大的误解，那我就免费...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34B25351A41EBB4E","varia